    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Detective Rainy Night places you in the shoes of Iker Carmona, a police officer tasked with investigating strange disappearances in the area.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After driving all day, Iker decides to spend the night at a motel called \u201cHoliday.\u201d\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389720/extras/f93ae62b1fbb438e3e2bc1bea29f36d6.poster.avif?t=1734427362\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389720/extras/f93ae62b1fbb438e3e2bc1bea29f36d6.webm?t=1734427362\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389720/extras/f93ae62b1fbb438e3e2bc1bea29f36d6.mp4?t=1734427362\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The next morning, he hears an argument outside his room. Upon stepping out, he discovers there is no electricity, mobile phones and computers aren\u2019t working, vehicles won\u2019t start, and it has begun to rain heavily.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389720/extras/3ac65603022bf010a7d5e12669538d26.poster.avif?t=1734427362\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389720/extras/3ac65603022bf010a7d5e12669538d26.webm?t=1734427362\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389720/extras/3ac65603022bf010a7d5e12669538d26.mp4?t=1734427362\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seven guests are staying at the motel alongside you, each with their own story. As the weather worsens and vehicles remain unusable, no one can leave the motel.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over five days divided into 12 narrative-driven levels, you will experience unexplained phenomena, disappearances, deaths, and cryptic symbols\u2014all unfolding within the motel.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389720/extras/a1fd8c29fa8e11e2bd8bd434fc40892f.poster.avif?t=1734427362\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389720/extras/a1fd8c29fa8e11e2bd8bd434fc40892f.webm?t=1734427362\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389720/extras/a1fd8c29fa8e11e2bd8bd434fc40892f.mp4?t=1734427362\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a police detective, your role will involve speaking to guests, interrogating them, and piecing together the truth behind these events.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Detective Rainy Night is a guided narrative adventure with elements of deduction. Throughout the game, events will unfold that you\u2019ll need to recall later to solve the case.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389720/extras/b8fa9e074453db99a25dd79030fc944a.poster.avif?t=1734427362\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389720/extras/b8fa9e074453db99a25dd79030fc944a.webm?t=1734427362\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389720/extras/b8fa9e074453db99a25dd79030fc944a.mp4?t=1734427362\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Violent crimes, mature stories, and psychological terror await you in the Motel Holiday. Grab a pen and paper because cracking this case won\u2019t be easy.\u00a0</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Detective Rainy Night places you in the shoes of Iker Carmona, a police officer tasked with investigating strange disappearances in the area.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After driving all day, Iker decides to spend the night at a motel called \u201cHoliday.\u201d\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389720/extras/f93ae62b1fbb438e3e2bc1bea29f36d6.poster.avif?t=1734427362\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389720/extras/f93ae62b1fbb438e3e2bc1bea29f36d6.webm?t=1734427362\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389720/extras/f93ae62b1fbb438e3e2bc1bea29f36d6.mp4?t=1734427362\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The next morning, he hears an argument outside his room. Upon stepping out, he discovers there is no electricity, mobile phones and computers aren\u2019t working, vehicles won\u2019t start, and it has begun to rain heavily.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389720/extras/3ac65603022bf010a7d5e12669538d26.poster.avif?t=1734427362\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389720/extras/3ac65603022bf010a7d5e12669538d26.webm?t=1734427362\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389720/extras/3ac65603022bf010a7d5e12669538d26.mp4?t=1734427362\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seven guests are staying at the motel alongside you, each with their own story. As the weather worsens and vehicles remain unusable, no one can leave the motel.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over five days divided into 12 narrative-driven levels, you will experience unexplained phenomena, disappearances, deaths, and cryptic symbols\u2014all unfolding within the motel.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389720/extras/a1fd8c29fa8e11e2bd8bd434fc40892f.poster.avif?t=1734427362\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389720/extras/a1fd8c29fa8e11e2bd8bd434fc40892f.webm?t=1734427362\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389720/extras/a1fd8c29fa8e11e2bd8bd434fc40892f.mp4?t=1734427362\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a police detective, your role will involve speaking to guests, interrogating them, and piecing together the truth behind these events.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Detective Rainy Night is a guided narrative adventure with elements of deduction. Throughout the game, events will unfold that you\u2019ll need to recall later to solve the case.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389720/extras/b8fa9e074453db99a25dd79030fc944a.poster.avif?t=1734427362\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389720/extras/b8fa9e074453db99a25dd79030fc944a.webm?t=1734427362\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389720/extras/b8fa9e074453db99a25dd79030fc944a.mp4?t=1734427362\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Violent crimes, mature stories, and psychological terror await you in the Motel Holiday. Grab a pen and paper because cracking this case won\u2019t be easy.\u00a0</p>",
